capability float/min-max  the smaller and the larger of two floats
  heroes  math.min, math.max
  go      Min, Max
  rust    f64::min, max, minimum, maximum
  python  fmin, fmax, min, max
  note    a nan answers nan, IEEE 754-2019's and Rust's `minimum`: C's `fmin`, Rust's `min` and Python's `fmin` drop the nan and so hide the mistake that made it, Go keeps it except beside an infinity, and Python's built-in answers by the order of its arguments; minus zero is below zero

