capability int/add-sub-mul  the sum, difference, product and negation of integers, or the failure that it does not fit
  heroes  math.add_i64, math.subtract_i64, math.multiply_i64, math.negate_i64, math.add_u64, math.subtract_u64, math.multiply_u64
